window.KT_I18N=window.KT_I18N||{};window.KT_I18N["zh-Hant"]={"About | KungfuTutor":"關於 | KungfuTutor","About KungfuTutor.com — interactive movement lessons for kung fu, martial arts, self-defence and sports.":"關於 KungfuTutor.com——功夫、武術、防身與運動的互動動作課程。","KungfuTutor — Interactive Kung Fu, Martial Arts & Sports Movement Lessons":"KungfuTutor — 互動式功夫、武術與運動動作課程","Learn kung fu, fighting, self-defence and sports skills from animated, interactive movement demos. Slow it down, step through it, and understand why it works.":"透過動畫互動示範，學習功夫、格鬥、自我防衛與運動技能。可以放慢速度、逐步觀看，並理解其中的道理。","Privacy Policy | KungfuTutor":"隱私政策 | KungfuTutor","How KungfuTutor.com handles data, cookies and advertising.":"KungfuTutor.com 如何處理資料、Cookie 與廣告。","Terms & Safety | KungfuTutor":"條款與安全 | KungfuTutor","Terms of use and training safety notice for KungfuTutor.com.":"KungfuTutor.com 的使用條款及訓練安全須知。","Boxing Basics: Stance, Jab, Cross, Hook, Uppercut & Defence — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"拳擊基礎：站姿、Jab、Cross、Hook、Uppercut 與防守 — 互動指南 | KungfuTutor","Learn 10 boxing fundamentals with animated demos against an opponent: stance and guard, jab, cross, lead hook, rear uppercut, the 1-2, slip, bob and weave, parry and footwork — with mistakes and drills.":"透過與對手對打的動畫示範，學習 10 項拳擊基本功：站姿與護手、Jab、Cross、前手勾拳、後手上勾拳、1-2、閃避、低頭搖閃、格擋與步法，並附常見錯誤與練習方法。","Boxing Basics — Punches, Defence & Footwork, Step by Step":"拳擊基礎——出拳、防守與步法，循序漸進","What are the basic punches in boxing?":"拳擊的基本拳法有哪些？","The jab, the cross, the hook and the uppercut. Coaches often number them: 1 jab, 2 cross, 3 lead hook, 4 rear hook, 5 lead uppercut, 6 rear uppercut.":"分別是刺拳（Jab）、直拳（Cross）、勾拳（Hook）和上勾拳（Uppercut）。教練常為它們編號：1 Jab、2 Cross、3 前手 Hook、4 後手 Hook、5 前手 Uppercut、6 後手 Uppercut。","What does 1-2 mean in boxing?":"拳擊中的「1-2」是什麼意思？","A jab followed immediately by a cross — the most basic boxing combination.":"刺拳後緊接著一記直拳——是最基本的拳擊組合。","What is the difference between a slip and a bob and weave?":"閃避（Slip）和低頭搖閃（Bob and Weave）有什麼區別？","A slip moves the head a little to the side to make a straight punch miss; a bob and weave bends the knees to duck under a hook in a U-shaped path.":"閃避是將頭部稍微側移，讓直線拳落空；低頭搖閃則是屈膝，沿U形路線低身閃過勾拳。","Filipino Martial Arts Basics: Kali, Eskrima & Arnis Stick Fighting — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"菲律賓武術基礎：Kali、Eskrima 與 Arnis 棍術 — 互動指南 | KungfuTutor","Learn 8 Filipino martial arts (Kali, Eskrima, Arnis) basics with animated stick demos: stance and grip, forehand and backhand diagonal strikes, thrust, figure-8 flow, roof block and counter, live-hand check and disarm, and empty-hand application.":"透過動畫棍法示範，學習 8 種菲律賓武術（Kali、Eskrima、Arnis）的基礎：站姿與握法、正手與反手斜向擊打、刺擊、8 字連續動作、屋頂式格擋與反擊、活手檢查與繳械，以及徒手應用。","Kali, Eskrima & Arnis Basics — Stick Fighting, Step by Step":"Kali、Eskrima 與 Arnis 基礎——循序漸進學棍術","What is the difference between Kali, Eskrima and Arnis?":"Kali、Eskrima 和 Arnis 有什麼分別？","They are three common names for the Filipino martial arts; which name is used depends largely on region and school. All of them train weapons first, usually sticks and blades, and apply the same angles to empty-hand fighting.":"它們是菲律賓武術的三個常見名稱，用哪一個名稱很大程度上取決於地區和門派。它們都先練習武器，通常是棍和刀，並把相同的角度應用於徒手格鬥。","Why do Filipino martial arts start with weapons?":"菲律賓武術為什麼先從武器練起？","Because the same angles and movements carry over to the empty hand: a forehand stick strike becomes a hammer fist or palm strike, and the live-hand check works the same way.":"因為相同的角度和動作可以轉用到徒手上：正手棍擊會變成錘拳或掌擊，活手檢查的運作方式也相同。","What is the live hand in FMA?":"FMA 中的活手是什麼？","The hand that does not hold the weapon. It checks, pushes, grabs and controls the opponent's weapon hand while the weapon hand attacks and defends.":"不持武器的那隻手。當持武器的手在進攻和防守時，它負責格擋、推開、抓住並控制對方持武器的手。","Judo Basics: Bow, Breakfalls, Throws, Hold-Downs & Armlock — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"柔道基礎：禮法、倒法、投技、固技與關節技——互動指南 | KungfuTutor","Learn 8 judo fundamentals with animated demos against a partner: bow, posture and grips, the back breakfall, advanced foot sweep, major outer reap, minor inner reap, major hip throw, scarf hold-down and the cross armlock.":"透過與夥伴的動畫示範，學習 8 項柔道基礎：行禮、姿勢與握法、背部倒法、進階掃腳、大外刈、小內刈、大腰投、袈裟固壓制和十字固關節技。","Judo Basics — Throws, Hold-Downs and the Armlock, Step by Step":"柔道基礎——投技、固技與關節技，循序漸進","A Japanese martial art and Olympic sport founded by Jigoro Kano in Tokyo in 1882. Players wear a jacket (judogi) and win by throwing, holding down or making the opponent submit. The name means 'the gentle way'.":"一種日本武術，也是奧運項目，由嘉納治五郎於1882年在東京創立。選手穿著道衣（judogi），以投摔、壓制或使對手認輸取勝。此名的意思是「柔之道」。","How do you score ippon in judo?":"柔道中如何得到一本？","By throwing the opponent largely onto their back with force and speed, by holding them down for 20 seconds, or by making them submit to a choke or armlock. Two waza-ari also add up to ippon.":"以力量和速度把對手大幅摔至背部著地、壓制對手20秒，或使對手因勒技或關節技認輸。兩個技有效也可合計為一本。","Can you grab the legs in judo?":"柔道中可以抓腿嗎？","No. Under International Judo Federation rules, gripping, hooking or touching the legs with the hands is not allowed and is penalised with shido.":"不可以。根據國際柔道聯盟的規則，用手抓、勾或觸碰腿部是不允許的，會被判罰指導（shido）。","Lethwei Basics: Burmese Bare-Knuckle Boxing, the Art of Nine Limbs | KungfuTutor":"Lethwei基礎：緬甸裸拳拳擊，九肢之術 | KungfuTutor","An animated introduction to Lethwei, Myanmar's bare-knuckle art of nine limbs: stance, bare-knuckle punches, the headbutt, rising elbow, flying knee, kicks, catch-and-sweep and the high cover — with safety notes.":"以動畫介紹Lethwei，即緬甸的裸拳九肢之術：站姿、裸拳拳法、頭擊、上挑肘、飛膝、踢法、抓握與掃腿，以及高位防守，並附安全提示。","Lethwei Basics — The Art of Nine Limbs, Step by Step":"Lethwei基礎——九肢之術，循序漸進","Why is Lethwei called the art of nine limbs?":"為什麼Lethwei被稱為九肢之術？","Because it adds the head to the eight weapons of Muay Thai: two fists, two elbows, two knees, two shins or feet, and headbutts.":"因為它在泰拳的八種武器之外加上了頭部：兩拳、兩肘、兩膝、兩脛或兩腳，以及頭擊。","No. Lethwei is fought bare-knuckle, with the hands wrapped in gauze and tape.":"不需要。Lethwei以裸拳進行，雙手纏繞紗布和膠帶。","What is the difference between Lethwei and Muay Thai?":"Lethwei和泰拳有什麼區別？","Lethwei is bare-knuckle and allows headbutts, and throws and sweeps are part of the game; Muay Thai is fought in gloves and does not allow headbutts.":"Lethwei採用裸拳，允許頭擊，投摔和掃腿也是比賽的一部分；泰拳則戴拳套比賽，不允許頭擊。","MMA Basics: Stance, Striking, Takedowns, Sprawl & Ground Game — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"MMA基礎：站姿、打擊、摔倒、防摔與地面技術 — 互動指南 | KungfuTutor","Learn 8 mixed martial arts fundamentals with animated demos against an opponent: MMA stance, jab-cross, overhand, low kick, double-leg takedown, sprawl, ground and pound from mount and the technical stand-up.":"透過與對手對練的動畫示範，學習8項綜合格鬥基礎：MMA站姿、刺拳接直拳、過頂拳、低踢、雙腿抱摔、sprawl防摔、騎乘位地面重拳打擊，以及技術起身。","MMA Basics — Striking and Grappling, Step by Step":"MMA基礎——打擊與摔角，循序漸進","What are the basics of MMA?":"MMA的基本是什麼？","A stance that defends both strikes and takedowns, basic punches and kicks, a takedown such as the double-leg, takedown defence such as the sprawl, and control on the ground, plus getting back to your feet safely.":"一種同時防禦打擊與摔法的站姿，基本拳法與腿法，雙腿摔等摔法，防摔（sprawl）等摔法防禦，以及地面控制，還有如何安全地重新站起來。","What is a sprawl in MMA?":"MMA中的sprawl是什麼？","A takedown defence: as the opponent shoots for your legs, you throw your legs back and drop your hips onto their upper back so they cannot reach your legs, then get back up.":"一種防摔動作：當對手撲向你的雙腿時，你將雙腿向後蹬出，臀部下沉壓在對手上背，使其無法抓到你的腿，然後再站起來。","What is a technical stand-up?":"什麼是技術起身？","A safe way to get up from the floor: post one hand behind you, plant the opposite foot, lift the hips, swing the straight leg back underneath you and stand up at a distance, eyes on the opponent.":"一種從地面安全起身的方法：一手撐在身後，另一側腳踩穩，抬起臀部，將伸直的腿向後擺到身下，然後與對手保持距離站起，眼睛始終盯著對手。","Muay Thai Basics: Stance, Teep, Roundhouse, Elbow, Knee & Clinch — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"泰拳基礎：站姿、前踢、迴旋踢、肘擊、膝擊與纏抱──互動指南 | KungfuTutor","Learn 10 Muay Thai fundamentals with animated demos against an opponent: stance, jab, cross, teep, roundhouse kick, low kick, elbow, clinch, knee and shin check — with common mistakes and drills.":"透過與對手的動畫示範，學習10項泰拳基本功：站姿、直拳、勾拳、前踢、迴旋踢、低踢、肘擊、纏抱、膝擊和護脛──包括常見錯誤與練習方法。","Muay Thai Basics — The Art of Eight Limbs, Step by Step":"泰拳基礎──八肢之術，逐步學習","Why is Muay Thai called the art of eight limbs?":"為什麼泰拳被稱為八肢之術？","Because it strikes with eight points of contact: two fists, two elbows, two knees and two shins, plus clinch work to control the opponent.":"因為它用八個接觸點進行攻擊：兩拳、兩肘、兩膝和兩脛，並配合纏抱來控制對手。","What is a teep in Muay Thai?":"泰拳中的前踢是什麼？","A push kick: lift the knee, then push the hips forward and drive the ball of the foot into the opponent's stomach or hips to stop them and restore distance.":"一種推踢：提膝，然後向前頂髖，用腳掌前部蹬向對手的腹部或髖部，以阻止對方並重建距離。","Do you kick with the foot or the shin in Muay Thai?":"在泰拳中，你是用腳還是用脛骨踢？","The roundhouse and low kick land with the shin, which is far tougher than the foot and carries more power when the hip turns over.":"迴旋踢和低踢以脛骨命中，它比腳更堅硬，並且在髖部轉動時能產生更大的力量。","Sambo Basics: Grips, Breakfalls, Throws, Hold-Downs & Leg Locks — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"Sambo 基礎：握法、倒地技巧、投摔、壓制與腿部關節技 — 互動教學 | KungfuTutor","Learn 8 sambo fundamentals with animated demos against a partner: stance and jacket grips, the back breakfall, forward foot sweep, back trip, single-leg pick-up, side hold-down, straight ankle lock and a combat sambo strike-to-throw.":"透過與夥伴對練的動畫示範，學習 8 項 Sambo 基本功：站姿與上衣握法、後倒保護、前腳掃、後絆摔、單腿抱起、側壓制、直線踝關節鎖，以及實戰 Sambo 的打擊轉投技。","Sambo Basics — Throws, Hold-Downs and Leg Locks, Step by Step":"Sambo 基礎 — 投摔、壓制與腿部關節技，循序漸進","A grappling martial art and sport developed in the Soviet Union in the 1920s and 1930s. The name is a Russian short form of 'self-defence without weapons'. Fighters wear a jacket and win with throws, hold-downs and joint locks.":"一種摔跤式的格鬥技擊與運動，於 1920 年代至 1930 年代在蘇聯發展起來。其名稱是俄語「不用武器的自衛」的簡稱。選手穿著上衣，以投摔、壓制和關節技取勝。","What is the difference between sport sambo and combat sambo?":"競技 Sambo（sport sambo）與實戰 Sambo（combat sambo）有什麼區別？","Sport sambo is a jacket-wrestling sport with throws, hold-downs and arm and leg locks but no chokes. Combat sambo adds punches, kicks, knees, elbows and chokes, and was built for military and police self-defence.":"競技 Sambo 是一項穿著上衣的摔跤運動，包括投摔、壓制以及手臂和腿部關節技，但不允許勒頸。實戰 Sambo 則加入拳擊、踢擊、膝擊、肘擊和勒頸，原為軍隊與警察的自衛而設計。","By a clean throw that lands the opponent on their back while you stay standing, by a submission, or on points from throws and hold-downs. A 10-second hold-down scores 2 points and a 20-second hold-down scores 4.":"透過乾淨俐落的投摔，使對手背部著地而你仍站立，或以關節技使對手投降，或以投摔和壓制得分取勝。10 秒的壓制得 2 分，20 秒的壓制得 4 分。","Gym Exercises for Beginners: 10 Key Movements with Correct Form | KungfuTutor":"初學者健身房訓練：10 個關鍵動作與正確姿勢 | KungfuTutor","Learn correct form for 10 essential gym exercises with step-by-step animation: squat, deadlift, bench press, overhead press, bent-over row, pull-up, push-up, reverse lunge, plank and glute bridge — with beginner versions, common mistakes, sets and reps.":"透過逐步動畫學習 10 個基礎健身房動作的正確姿勢：深蹲、硬舉、臥推、肩上推舉、俯身划船、引體向上、伏地挺身、反向弓步、平板支撐和臀橋。內容包括初學者版本、常見錯誤、組數與次數。","Gym Basics — 10 Exercises with Correct Form, Animated":"健身房基礎：10 個動作，正確姿勢，動畫演示","What are the best gym exercises for beginners?":"初學者最好的健身房動作有哪些？","A balanced beginner plan covers a squat, a hip hinge such as the deadlift or glute bridge, a horizontal push (bench press or push-up), a vertical push (overhead press), a pull (row or pull-up), a single-leg move (lunge) and a core exercise (plank).":"均衡的初學者計劃包括：深蹲；髖部鉸鏈動作，如硬舉或臀橋；水平推舉，如臥推或伏地挺身；垂直推舉，如肩上推舉；拉的動作，如划船或引體向上；單腿動作，如弓步；以及核心訓練，如平板支撐。","How many sets and reps should a beginner do?":"初學者應該做多少組和次數？","Two to four sets of about 8 to 12 reps with a weight you can lift with good form, leaving one or two reps in reserve, two or three times a week.":"每週兩到三次，每組大約 8 到 12 次，使用你能以良好姿勢舉起的重量，每組保留一到兩次餘力，做兩到四組。","Should the bar stay over the middle of the foot?":"深蹲、硬舉和肩上推舉等站立槓鈴動作中，槓鈴是否應保持在中足上方？","In standing barbell lifts like the squat, deadlift and overhead press, keeping the bar roughly over mid-foot keeps you balanced and the lift efficient.":"在深蹲、硬舉和肩上推舉等站立槓鈴動作中，讓槓鈴大致保持在中足上方，可以幫助你保持平衡並提高動作效率。","BOTH FEET STAY ON THE BASE":"雙腳始終踩在底座上","STAY IN YOUR LANE · 4 × 12.5 m":"留在自己的跑道內 · 4 × 12.5 m","STAND UP · STAY INSIDE THE BOX":"站起來 · 留在方框內","CHEST MUST TOUCH THE GROUND":"胸部必須觸地","STAY SEATED UNTIL 1,000 m":"坐好直到 1,000 m","ARMS STRAIGHT BY YOUR SIDES":"手臂伸直貼於身體兩側","KNEE MUST TOUCH GROUND":"膝蓋必須觸地","HIPS BELOW KNEES · HIT THE TARGET":"臀部低於膝蓋 · 擊中目標","HYROX 8 Stations Explained — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"HYROX 8 個站點詳解 — 互動指南 | KungfuTutor","Interactive HYROX guide: all 8 stations in race order with animated movement demos, official weights for every division (Open, Pro, Doubles, Relay), judging standards and training tips.":"HYROX 互動指南：依比賽順序介紹全部 8 個站點，附動畫動作示範，列出每個組別（Open、Pro、Doubles、Relay）的官方重量、評判標準和訓練建議。","HYROX 8 Stations — Interactive Movement Guide":"HYROX 8 個站點：互動動作指南","SkiErg 1,000 m, Sled Push 50 m, Sled Pull 50 m, Burpee Broad Jumps 80 m, Rowing 1,000 m, Farmers Carry 200 m, Sandbag Lunges 100 m and 100 Wall Balls, each after a 1 km run.":"SkiErg 1,000 m、Sled Push 50 m、Sled Pull 50 m、Burpee Broad Jumps 80 m、Rowing 1,000 m、Farmers Carry 200 m、Sandbag Lunges 100 m，以及 100 Wall Balls，每項之前都先跑 1 km。","How heavy is the HYROX sled push?":"HYROX 的雪橇推重有多重？","Including the sled: 102 kg for Women Open, 152 kg for Women Pro and Men Open, and 202 kg for Men Pro.":"包括雪橇在內：女子 Open 為 102 kg，女子 Pro 和男子 Open 為 152 kg，男子 Pro 為 202 kg。","How high is the HYROX wall ball target?":"HYROX 的 wall ball 目標高度是多少？","2.70 m for women and 3.00 m for men, in both Open and Pro.":"女子組（Open 和 Pro 均適用）為 2.70 m，男子組（Open 和 Pro 均適用）為 3.00 m。","5 Basic Kung Fu Stances: Horse, Bow, Empty, Drop & Cross — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"5 種基本功夫步型：馬步、弓步、虛步、仆步與交叉步——互動指南 | KungfuTutor","Learn the five basic kung fu stances — Ma Bu (horse), Gong Bu (bow), Xu Bu (empty), Pu Bu (drop) and Xie Bu (cross) — with animated front and side views, foot placement, weight distribution, common mistakes and a stance timer.":"學習五種基本功夫步型——Ma Bu（馬步）、Gong Bu（弓步）、Xu Bu（虛步）、Pu Bu（仆步）與 Xie Bu（交叉步）——包括動畫正面與側面視圖、腳位、重心分配、常見錯誤及步型計時器。","The 5 Basic Kung Fu Stances — Interactive Guide":"5 種基本功夫步型——互動指南","Horse stance (Ma Bu), bow stance (Gong Bu), empty stance (Xu Bu), drop stance (Pu Bu) and cross stance (Xie Bu).":"馬步（Ma Bu）、弓步（Gong Bu）、虛步（Xu Bu）、仆步（Pu Bu）和丁字步（Xie Bu）。","Start with three sets of about 30 seconds with good form and build gradually towards two minutes. Stand higher rather than letting the knees cave in.":"從三組約30秒開始，動作姿勢要正確，然後逐步增加到兩分鐘。站高一些，不要讓膝蓋內扣。","Is horse stance bad for your knees?":"馬步對膝蓋有害嗎？","With knees tracking over the toes and a depth you can control, it is a common strength exercise. Pain is a signal to stand higher or stop and seek advice from an instructor or doctor.":"膝蓋與腳尖方向一致，並且下蹲深度在自己可控制的範圍內，這是一種常見的力量訓練。疼痛是一個信號，代表應該站高一點，或停止並向教練或醫生請教。","Basic Kung Fu Punches & Kicks: 6 Essential Techniques — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"功夫基礎拳法與腿法：6 項必學技術——互動指南 | KungfuTutor","Learn six basic kung fu techniques — straight punch, palm strike, snap kick, heel thrust kick, side kick and front stretch kick — with step-by-step animation, striking points, common mistakes and practice tips.":"學習六種基礎功夫技術——直拳、掌擊、彈踢、蹬踢、側踢和前伸踢——附分步動畫、擊打部位、常見錯誤和練習建議。","Kung Fu Punches & Kicks — Interactive Step-by-Step Guide":"功夫拳法與腿法——互動分步指南","What is the difference between a snap kick and a heel thrust kick?":"彈踢和蹬踢有什麼分別？","A snap kick (Tan Tui) whips the lower leg out from a lifted knee with the toes pointed and strikes with the tip of the foot. A heel thrust kick (Deng Tui) pulls the toes back and pushes the heel out in a straight line.":"彈踢（彈腿）從提起的膝蓋處將小腿甩出，腳尖繃直，用腳尖端擊打。蹬踢（蹬腿）將腳趾勾回，沿直線把腳跟推出。","How do you make a correct kung fu fist?":"怎樣做出正確的功夫拳？","Curl the four fingers tightly into the palm and fold the thumb across the middle of the index and middle fingers. Keep the wrist straight so the knuckles and forearm form one line.":"四指緊緊捲入掌心，拇指橫扣在食指和中指的中段。手腕保持挺直，使指節與前臂成一直線。","Should I warm up before practising kicks?":"練習腿法前需要熱身嗎？","Yes. Warm up the hips, knees and ankles and do light stretches first; never swing kicks hard when cold.":"需要。先熱身髖、膝和踝關節，並做輕度伸展；身體冷的時候切勿用力甩腿。","Tai Chi 24-Form: All 24 Postures with Animation & Breathing Guide | KungfuTutor":"太極拳24式：全部24個動作配動畫與呼吸指南 | KungfuTutor","Learn the simplified Tai Chi 24-form (Yang style) posture by posture: animated demos of all 24 movements, step-by-step breakdowns, a breathing cue, key points, common mistakes and a play-the-whole-form mode.":"逐式學習簡化太極24式（楊式）：24個動作的動畫示範、分步拆解、呼吸提示、要點、常見錯誤，以及整套連續練習模式。","Tai Chi 24-Form — All 24 Postures, Animated":"太極24式——全部24個動作動畫演示","What is the Tai Chi 24-form?":"什麼是太極24式？","A short sequence of 24 postures based on Yang-style Tai Chi, created in 1956 in China to make Tai Chi easier to learn. It usually takes about 4 to 6 minutes to perform.":"這是一套以楊式太極拳為基礎的短套路，由24個動作組成，1956年在中國創編，目的是讓太極拳更易學。完整演練通常需要約4至6分鐘。","How long does it take to learn the 24-form?":"學會24式需要多久？","Many beginners learn the sequence in a few weeks to a few months of regular practice; refining it takes much longer. Learning one group of postures at a time helps.":"許多初學者經過數週至數月的定期練習即可學會整套動作；要練得純熟則需要更長時間。一次學習一組動作會有所幫助。","Is Tai Chi good for balance?":"太極拳有助於平衡能力嗎？","Research reviews suggest Tai Chi may help improve balance and reduce fall risk in older adults. Check with a doctor if you have health concerns.":"研究綜述顯示，太極拳可能有助於改善長者的平衡能力並降低跌倒風險。如有健康疑慮，請先諮詢醫生。","Wing Chun Basics: Stance, Vertical Punch, Chain Punch, Tan, Bong, Fuk & Pak Sao — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"詠春基礎：馬步、直拳、連環拳、黏手、膀手、伏手與拍手——互動指南 | KungfuTutor","Learn 8 Wing Chun basics from Siu Nim Tao — Yee Jee Kim Yeung Ma stance, vertical punch, chain punch, Tan Sao, Bong Sao, Fuk Sao, Pak Sao and the front kick — with step-by-step animation and a centreline guide.":"透過詠春拳的小念頭學習8個基本功——葉繼康楊家馬步、直拳、連環拳、黏手、膀手、伏手、拍手以及前踢，配有逐步動畫和中線指引。","Wing Chun Basics — Interactive Step-by-Step Guide":"詠春基礎——互動式逐步指南","What is the centreline in Wing Chun?":"詠春中的中線是什麼？","An imaginary vertical line down the middle of the body. Wing Chun techniques protect your own centreline and attack along the shortest, straightest path to the opponent's.":"一條從身體正中央垂直向下的假想線。詠春的招式保護自己的中線，並沿著最短、最直的路徑攻向對手的中線。","What are the three basic hand shapes in Wing Chun?":"詠春中的三種基本手型是什麼？","Tan Sao (dispersing hand), Bong Sao (wing arm) and Fuk Sao (bridge-on hand), all trained first in the Siu Nim Tao form.":"黏手（分散手）、膀手（翼臂）和伏手（搭橋手），三者都先在小念頭套路中練習。","Why does the Wing Chun punch use a vertical fist?":"為什麼詠春拳的衝拳使用豎拳？","With the thumb side up, the elbow can stay down behind the fist on the centreline, giving a short, straight and well-supported punch.":"拇指一側朝上時，手肘可以保持在拳頭後方的中線下方，使拳路短、直，並獲得良好支撐。","Self-Defence Basics: 8 Simple Moves to Stay Safe — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"防身基礎：8個保持安全的簡單動作——互動指南 | KungfuTutor","Learn eight basic self-defence moves with step-by-step animation: the fence, keeping distance, palm heel strike, hammer fist, elbow strike, low stomp kick, wrist-grab release and head cover — plus how to avoid trouble and get away safely.":"透過逐步動畫學習八個基本防身動作：格擋式（the fence）、保持距離、掌根擊、錘拳、肘擊、低位踩踢、手腕被抓後脫離，以及護頭；同時了解如何避免麻煩並安全脫身。","Self-Defence Basics — 8 Moves, Step by Step":"防身基礎——8個動作，逐步學習","What is the most important rule of self-defence?":"防身最重要的原則是什麼？","Avoid the fight and get away. Awareness, keeping your distance, a firm voice and leaving early prevent far more harm than any strike. Physical moves are a last resort to create a moment to escape.":"避免衝突並盡快離開。保持警覺、保持距離、語氣堅定，以及及早離開，遠比任何一擊更能防止傷害。身體動作只是最後手段，用來爭取脫身的機會。","How do you escape a wrist grab?":"如何脫離手腕被抓？","Don't pull straight back. Bend your elbow, step a little closer and rip your wrist out through the gap between their thumb and fingers, which is the weakest part of the grip. Then step back and leave.":"不要直接往後拉。屈肘，稍微靠近一步，從對方拇指和其他手指之間的縫隙把手腕抽出來，那裡是握力最弱的地方。然後後退一步並離開。","Laws differ between countries, but generally you may only use force that is reasonable and necessary to protect yourself, and you should stop and leave as soon as you are safe. Check the law where you live.":"各國法律不同，但一般而言，你只能使用合理且必要的武力保護自己，並且一旦安全就應停止並離開。請查詢你所在地的法律。","Krav Maga Basics: Stance, Defences, Choke Release & Counters — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"Krav Maga 基礎：站姿、防守、解脫前勒頸與反擊 — 互動指南 | KungfuTutor","Learn 8 Krav Maga self-defence basics with animated demos against an attacker: fighting stance, straight-punch burst, inside defence, 360° outside defence, front-choke release, groin kick, knee from the clinch, and breaking away to safety.":"透過動畫示範學習 8 項 Krav Maga 基礎防身技術，對付攻擊者：格鬥站姿、直拳爆發、內側防守、360° 外側防守、正面前勒頸解脫、踢襠、近身膝擊，以及脫身逃到安全處。","Krav Maga Basics — Defend, Counter, Get Away":"Krav Maga 基礎：防守、反擊、脫身","A self-defence system developed in Israel that focuses on simple, instinctive movements: defend and counter at the same time, keep attacking until you can escape, and get away to safety.":"一套源自以色列的防身體系，專注於簡單、本能的動作：同時防守與反擊，持續攻擊直到能夠脫身，然後逃到安全處。","How do you escape a front choke?":"如何從正面前勒頸中脫身？","Bring both hands up, hook your fingers over the attacker's thumbs and pluck them down and out while tucking your chin, then counter and get away.":"雙手抬起，把手指勾住攻擊者的拇指，向下、向外扳開，同時收下巴，然後反擊並脫身。","What does retzev mean in Krav Maga?":"Krav Maga 中的 retzev 是什麼意思？","Continuous motion: once you have to fight back, you keep moving and striking without pausing until you can escape.":"持續移動：一旦必須還擊，就不停地移動和出擊，直到能夠脫身為止。","Golf Swing Basics: Setup, Backswing, Impact & Finish — Interactive Guide | KungfuTutor":"高爾夫揮桿基礎：站位、上桿、擊球與收桿 — 互動指南 | KungfuTutor","Learn the golf swing step by step with animation: setup posture, takeaway, top of the backswing, downswing, impact and finish, plus the full iron swing, driver, chip shot and putting stroke. Includes tempo, common mistakes and drills.":"透過動畫逐步學習高爾夫揮桿：站姿、起桿、上桿頂點、下桿、擊球和收桿，並包括鐵桿揮桿、一號木、切桿和推桿動作。內容包括節奏、常見錯誤和練習方法。","Golf Swing Basics — Interactive Step-by-Step Guide":"高爾夫揮桿基礎 — 互動式逐步指南","What are the main phases of the golf swing?":"高爾夫揮桿的主要階段有哪些？","Setup (address), takeaway, top of the backswing, downswing, impact and follow-through to a balanced finish.":"站位（預備姿勢）、起桿、上桿頂點、下桿、擊球，以及保持平衡的收桿。","What is a good golf swing tempo?":"良好的高爾夫揮桿節奏是怎樣的？","Many good players swing with roughly a 3 to 1 ratio: the backswing takes about three times as long as the downswing, for example about 0.75 seconds back and 0.25 seconds down.":"許多優秀球員的揮桿比例大約為 3 比 1：上桿時間約為下桿的三倍，例如上桿約 0.75 秒，下桿約 0.25 秒。","Where should the ball be in my stance?":"我的站位中球應該放在哪裡？","For a mid-iron, about the middle of the stance or slightly forward; for the driver, opposite the inside of the front heel; for a chip, slightly back of centre.":"中鐵桿一般位於站位中間或稍微靠前；一號木位於前腳腳跟內側的正對位置；切桿則稍微位於中心偏後。"};
